The Worldbuilder is licensed under a two-tier scheme.

There is no single licence for the whole repository. Which licence applies
depends on the directory a file lives in:

  * Apache-2.0           libraries, adapters, schemas, examples, docs
  * AGPL-3.0-or-later    the application (board app, API service, MCP server)

See LICENSING.md for the authoritative table. The LICENSE file inside each
package or directory governs that directory. Full licence texts are in the
LICENSES/ directory. Every source file carries an SPDX-License-Identifier
header.

Copyright The Worldbuilder contributors
